<p>The fund also supports the expansion of “Claude Labs” within these consulting firms. These dedicated innovation centers allow clients to stress-test AI solutions in a secure, pre-production environment. By providing free API credits and technical oversight, Anthropic reduces the R&#x26;D risk for partners who are exploring high-impact, high-complexity use cases such as automated mergers-and-acquisition research or real-time global supply chain re-routing. This collaborative approach ensures that when a solution is moved into production, it has already been vetted for both technical accuracy and business-level security compliance.</p>
