<p>To support this massive computational effort, DeepMind is leveraging Google Cloud’s <a href="/articles/google-cloud-tpu-v6-ai-supercomputing">TPU v6 supercomputing clusters</a>. This vertical integration allows for “near-real-time” protein simulations that can be shared instantly across a global network of research partners. DeepMind is also launching “AlphaFold-as-a-Service,” a secure API that allows biotech firms to run their own proprietary protein-folding simulations within the Gemini Enterprise Security Tier, ensuring that their intellectual property remains fully protected throughout the research cycle.</p>
