-->
<p>The Pixel 11 Pro also features an updated “Advanced Voice Mode,” which utilizes a dedicated audio-DSP to provide sub-200ms latency for voice interactions. This allows the built-in Project Astra assistant to function as a “Real-Time Translator” and “Professional Meeting Assistant,” capable of taking complex notes and summarizing action items during a live conversation without any cloud lag. This combination of “frontier-level” vision, voice, and text reasoning makes the Pixel 11 Pro the first true “AI-First” smartphone on the market.</p>
