<p>As the number of models on the platform sky-rockets, Hugging Face is also launching “Safe-Hugging,” an automated, AI-driven security auditing system for all new uploads. This system uses a specialized Gemini 2.0 reasoning layer to proactively scan models for potential backdoors, malicious code injections, or “unsafe” training data. This “Transparency-as-Security” model is a key part of the Global Open-Source AI Safety Alliance, which helps to standardize “Model-Cards” across the entire hub, ensuring that users can easily verify the provenance and alignment of any model they download.</p>
