<p>Hugging Face is also expanding into “Physical AI,” with a new section dedicated to Open Foundation Models for Humanoid Robotics. By providing a shared space for “Robot-Brains” that can be deployed on hardware like the Raspberry Pi 6, the platform is enabling a new era of “Open-Source Hardware” where the software is as accessible as the underlying silicon. This vertical integration of open intelligence is what the community believes will finally lead to the “Linux of Robotics,” where common standards and collective research drive the entire industry forward.</p>
