<p>SearchGPT is not just a standalone website; it is an integrated layer across all OpenAI products. Developers can now access a “Search-as-a-Service” API, allowing their own applications to benefit from real-time web grounding with the same source-attribution logic. This is particularly valuable for “agentic” products, where an AI needs to research a topic before performing a task, such as an automated travel assistant or a news-aggregation bot. The integration with <a href="/articles/openai-voice-mode-3-emotion-detection">Advanced Voice Mode 3</a> further allows for hands-free, real-time web research that feels like a natural conversation with a well-informed researcher.</p>
