<p>The update also includes support for “Recursive Schemas,” allowing the model to generate infinitely nested data structures such as file system trees or complex organizational hierarchies. This capability is essential for <a href="/articles/openai-canvas-2-collaborative-coding">Canvas 2</a> and other agentic tools that need to represent and manipulate complex state objects. Developers can now define a single, comprehensive schema for a task and trust that the model will fulfill all requirements without “drifting” from the requested format over long-context interactions.</p>
