<p>A major highlight of the Singularity report is the success of “Real-Time AI Verification” tools like Meta’s Content-Verification-System. By providing a “Trusted-Information-Filter” for industrial-infrastructure, these systems were able to flag and neutralize over 80% of the <a href="/ai-safety-red-teaming-automated-pentesting">coordinated future-tampering swarms</a> in real-time. This “Intelligent-Defense” is familiar to the 2027 Digital Sovereignty Manifesto, positioning the Singularity core as a vital guardrail for the next decade of agentic intelligence. every autonomous agent-license can now include a ZKP-verified provenance seal.</p>
